WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:06.000
Eldest Brother! Even if I were reckless to the heavens, I would never commit such treasonous impiety!

00:07.000 --> 00:13.000
Those aristocratic clans desire nothing more than to see our Sikong imperial family turn upon itself so they can reap the spoils!

00:13.400 --> 00:21.000
The commoners outside whisper: 'The Chen and the Sikong share the realm as equals!' Can you truly stomach such humiliation?!

00:22.960 --> 00:30.500
Eldest Brother... Eldest Brother! Do you truly intend to butcher your own flesh and blood?!

00:35.960 --> 00:40.000
Since you refuse to confess... you leave me no choice.
